    "body": "Plan §13 and the Phase 1 exit require a real CI workflow; today only the Pages deploy runs, which is why the κ baseline broke twice (stale pin, then platform-sensitive TLA5 pin merged ungated). Build .github/workflows/ci.yml: cargo fmt --check, cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings, cargo nextest run --workspace + cargo test --doc, allocation-freedom suite (pattern: tests/allocation_census.rs), kernel source-scan + op census, deterministic rebuild (extends #21), compiler T-invariance (T=1 vs T=4, plan §4.1), fuzz smoke (crates/uor-r4-graph-format/tests/fuzz_smoke.rs), dependency/license audit. Pinned-runner policy per D7: benchmark/κ gates may need the pinned dev machine or a fixed runner image. Plan: docs/r4_graph_compiler_implementation_plan.md §13.",
